    "description": "Assignment 2 (Group) 20.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MPR201 · Assessment 2/5</span>\n<h2>Assignment 2\n(Group)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13632 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">MPR201 · Đầu điểm 2/5</span>\n<h2>Assignment 2\n(Group)</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13632 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">in class or outdoor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO3<br>CLO4<br>CLO5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">practical exercises</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Group work to film a short video following the shot list.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">AI-Assisted Editing<br><br>Students are permitted to use AI to edit their work and make improvements to the clarity and quality of their work. AI can be used, but original work with no AI content and AI prompts and responses must be provided in appendix. Student acknowledge how they used AI in their final submission.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">From session 10 to 21<br>Each group (formed in session 1) selects one script from Assignment 1, then writes a teaser script, creates a shot list, and films a simple 20-second teaser<br>Editing is not required during class; groups only need to combine clips into one unedited sequence and export it<br>The final edited version must be submitted no later than 2 days afterward<br>Students are recommended to use AI tools to enhance the quality of shot footage</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 7 — ASSIGNMENT 1. Develop your first script</li><li>Session 8 — ASSIGNMENT 1. Develop your first script (continue)</li><li>Session 9 — ASSIGNMENT 1. Develop your first script (continue)</li><li>Session 22 — ASSIGNMENT 2 - PRODUCE YOUR TEASER</li><li>Session 23 — ASSIGNMENT 2 - PRODUCE YOUR TEASER</li><li>Session 24 — ASSIGNMENT 2 - PRODUCE YOUR TEASER</li><li>Session 31 — ASSIGNMENT 3 - MAKE IT HEARD</li><li>Session 32 — ASSIGNMENT 3 - MAKE IT HEARD</li><li>Session 33 — ASSIGNMENT 3 - MAKE IT HEARD</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 7 — ASSIGNMENT 1. Develop your first script</li><li>Buổi 8 — ASSIGNMENT 1. Develop your first script (continue)</li><li>Buổi 9 — ASSIGNMENT 1. Develop your first script (continue)</li><li>Buổi 22 — ASSIGNMENT 2 - PRODUCE YOUR TEASER</li><li>Buổi 23 — ASSIGNMENT 2 - PRODUCE YOUR TEASER</li><li>Buổi 24 — ASSIGNMENT 2 - PRODUCE YOUR TEASER</li><li>Buổi 31 — ASSIGNMENT 3 - MAKE IT HEARD</li><li>Buổi 32 — ASSIGNMENT 3 - MAKE IT HEARD</li><li>Buổi 33 — ASSIGNMENT 3 - MAKE IT HEARD</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
